  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Immediate multi-sectoral, live saving assistance for the population affected by the military operation in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will provide immediate, life-saving assistance to conflict-affected communities and IDPs, particularly elderly, people  with disabilities, women-led households, children in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide immediate, life-saving assistance to the most vulnerable individuals in Donetska, Luhanska, Kharkivska, Zaporizka and  Dnipropetrovska Oblast by improving their food security and access to essential WASH</narrative>
  </description>
